{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/cromwellian/status/2103028027861152225","id":"2103028027861152225","text":"I'm Upping My P(doom) C64 Demoscene version. I asked Opus 5.5 to make SID/VIC version in the style of C64 demos using rasterbars, scrollers, sprites, FLD, etc.  It wrote a VIC and SID emulator using Javascript, and proceeding to code up the demo using the lyrics. It failed fetching the music video, so the SID music doesn't really correspond, but not bad for a first try.","raw_text":{"text":"I'm Upping My P(doom) C64 Demoscene version. I asked Opus 5.5 to make SID/VIC version in the style of C64 demos using rasterbars, scrollers, sprites, FLD, etc.  It wrote a VIC and SID emulator using Javascript, and proceeding to code up the demo using the lyrics. It failed fetching the music video, so the SID music doesn't really correspond, but not bad for a first try.","display_text_range":[0,372],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[274,297],"id":"2103027515736633345","display":"pic.x.com/NC9aUqKGrD","original":"https://t.co/NC9aUqKGrD","replacement":"https://x.com/cromwellian/status/2103028027861152225/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"cromwellian","url":"https://x.com/cromwellian","id":"14120120","followers":2116,"following":142,"likes":336,"media_count":43,"name":"cromwellian","description":"The world has gone crazy.","raw_description":{"text":"The world has gone crazy.","facets":[]},"location":"Bay Area, California","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2010111701631238144/aTn4lxXX_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Mar 11 03:51:16 +0000 2008","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":1,"retweets":1,"likes":10,"bookmarks":2,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Thu Sep 24 07:45:28 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790235928,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":585,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"reply